            <profile id="465b-d57d-e41c-db7d" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Boyar has a hand weapon and heavy armour. May ride a horse (+12). If mounted, Feigned Flight. May have shield (+1), throwing or thrusting spear (+3) and (if dismounted) a double-handed weapon (+3). If mounted in a post-Mongol Conquest army, must have a composite bow (+4).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="684b-b28d-75cd-cb56" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
